                                                        "code": "History ph(0);\nHistory s(0);\nHistory g0(1.23456789e12);\nlen = max(1, int(8100 * samplerate / 1000));\nx = in1;\nxr = round(x * 1e6) / 1e6;\ngr = round(g0 * 1e6) / 1e6;\nchg = abs(xr - gr) > 1e-9;\nph = chg ? 0 : (ph + 1);\ns = chg ? x : s;\ng0 = x;\nt = min(ph, len);\nout1 = s * (1. - t / len);"
